notes               = "Untitled in source; dated تهران ۱۳۶۸ (Tehran, 1989). هذیان = 'delirium' (fever/shell-shock). Hinges on the symmetry نفرت از جنگ / نفرت از صلح (hatred of war in the eyes, of peace in the teeth). Shares the drained-palette imagery of the page-67 poem and the پناهگاه (shelter) of the page-60 poem. Imported as a draft with machine and lantern layers. Corrected (July 2026): this poem's ===translation=== held an agent rendering, staged there by the pages 61-69 bulk import. Per CLAUDE.md that layer is Ben's alone, so the rendering is now the ===lantern=== and ===translation=== is empty again, superseding the import's earlier and rougher lantern (kept in git history). date_translated is cleared for the same reason — it recorded 6/28/26, the date of the agent pass."
